# Purpose
Transcript and chapter-note pages for indexed videos.

# Key Files
- `greatvibe-first-screen-recording.md`
- `greatvibe-welcome.md`

# Dependencies
- `../index.json` points to transcript paths.

# Gotchas
- Do not include private video hashes, raw iframe HTML, or private user data.
- If full transcripts are unavailable, mark the page as a placeholder and keep
  summaries conservative.

# Change History
- 2026-08-03: Created transcript stubs for initial videos.
lastModified-david-story: 2026-10-12 — Index the legacy home video Why we built greatVibe as greatvibe-story with the official Vimeo captions and source metadata. Private playback hash remains server-side and is absent from public documentation.

# 2026-10-14 — David story replacement
Replaces the legacy 197-second story with Vimeo 1235643218 (426 seconds, 16:9), titled "Take on more. Stay in control." and attributed to David Jenkinson, CEO of greatVibe by Gravient. Captions track 331810675 is preserved byte-for-byte; readable transcript corrects GrapeVibe to greatVibe only. Public metadata contains no playback hash, API secret or signed caption URL. Current pricing guide remains authoritative. Stable greatvibe-story slug is preserved.
